.SS DESCRIPTION
The \f[CR]rtcTraversableIntersect4/8/16\f[R] functions are equivalent to
\f[CR]rtcIntersect4/8/16\f[R] but take a traversable object
(\f[CR]traversable\f[R] argument) instead of a scene object.
.PP
For more details, refer to the documentation of
\f[CR]rtcIntersect4/8/16\f[R].
